  <incorrect>In today's fast-paced digital world, leveraging optimized AI workflows can unlock your true financial potential.</incorrect>
</style_exemplars>
Match the tone, sentence cadence, and flat metric delivery of the correct exemplar precisely.
</tier_1_starter>

<tier_2_decision_grade>
Build on Tier 1 by adding explicit vocabulary constraints and structural rules:
<voice_calibration_engine>
  <style_exemplars>
    [Insert Tier 1 exemplars]
