Scan our entire conversation history and summarize our active project state inside <context_snapshot> tags.
Include only: current objective, key decisions made, and unresolved variables.
Do not include conversational commentary or redundant historical text.
</tier_1_starter>

<tier_2_decision_grade>
Build on Tier 1 by structuring the context snapshot for instant secondary chat ingestion:
<reindexing_engine>
  <context_snapshot>
    <core_objective>[State the final goal in 1 sentence]</core_objective>
    <validated_facts>[List confirmed constraints and metrics]</validated_facts>
    <active_variables>[List items currently requiring resolution]</active_variables>
